{"id":"906d5282a041cf8e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyAccept.md","title":"PolyAccept","display":"PolyAccept","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyAccept","parameters":["d","g","t","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyAccept"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>d</span><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 类型判断与独立算法。有序参数：<code>d</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyAccept d g t a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and (@ PolyTy d a) (exists r (and (@ OK a r) (@ PolySynth d g t r))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c6f16aed01caed9d\" href=\"?note=c6f16aed01caed9d\" title=\"ZFC_OK\">OK</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ac0d7af354f31240\" href=\"?note=ac0d7af354f31240\" title=\"ZFC_PolySynth\">PolySynth</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d8ed31ea0d65b588\" href=\"?note=d8ed31ea0d65b588\" title=\"ZFC_PolyTy\">PolyTy</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyAccept d g t a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_OK","status":"resolved","id":"c6f16aed01caed9d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_OK|OK]]；[[ZFC_PolySynth|PolySynth]]；[[ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PolySynth","status":"resolved","id":"ac0d7af354f31240","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_OK|OK]]；[[ZFC_PolySynth|PolySynth]]；[[ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_PolyTy","status":"resolved","id":"d8ed31ea0d65b588","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_OK|OK]]；[[ZFC_PolySynth|PolySynth]]；[[ZFC_PolyTy|PolyTy]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":860,"backlinks":[{"id":"ffceeafdf689edfc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_PolyAccept|PolyAccept]]"},{"id":"1f2a6a2e1de8a327","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_PolyAccept|PolyAccept]]；[[ZFC_PolyType|PolyType]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-552","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_PolyAccept|PolyAccept]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","c6f16aed01caed9d","ac0d7af354f31240","d8ed31ea0d65b588","593f9bdab4d60707"]}